 "blurb": "Pinyon, juniper and oak mesas, where jays plant the forest and fire resets it.",
 "tip": {
  "id": "rain",
  "title": "Dry out the mesa",
  "text": "Rain and snowmelt feed every plant here. Set Rain & snowmelt to -100% and watch the pinyon, oak and shrubs fade, then the deer, jays and the predators above them."
 },
